# Trial by Earth (bastok 61): the offer's SMN AF arguments. The Puppet Master (windurst 81) accepted at Prog 0: smnAF is
# false on its Prog side, so 249 has the plain arguments (0, fork); The Puppet Master's own 256 (a progress too) comes
# after Trial by Earth in Juroro's order and does not play. At Prog 1 smnAF is true: 249's fourth, sixth and seventh
# arguments are 1, the Earth Pendulum and 1; the char holds the pendulum, so The Puppet Master answers 253 (an Event,
# below 249's Progress). Then completed with the Timer gone: the same arguments on the repeat offer.
lists PortBastok/Juroro/onTrigger PortBastok/onEventFinish/249
char zone=PortBastok pos=32,7,-41 job=SMN lvl=75
fame Bastok 425
quest Windurst.ThePuppetMaster accepted
item EarthPendulum
login
trigger Juroro                 # The Puppet Master at Prog 0: smnAF false, 249 (0, fork)
finish option=0                # declined: nothing
charvar Quest[2][81]Prog 1
trigger Juroro                 # 249 (0, fork, 0, 1, 0, Earth Pendulum, 1)
finish option=0                # declined
quest Bastok.TrialByEarth completed
trigger Juroro                 # completed, Timer 0: 249 with the same arguments
finish option=0                # declined
